Uni2-VGA16.psf.gz comes from Debian's console-setup (https://salsa.debian.org/installer-team/console-setup), built there from u_vga16_fix.bdf, u_vga16.bdf and legacy16*.bdf. Below, unchanged, are the parts of its copyright.fonts (commit d8574f7) that cover those: its opening statement, u_vga16.bdf, and the legacy fonts.

All console fonts are public domain by nature.  The copiright terms of
the source BDF-fonts in the directory Fonts/bdf of the source package
follow.

